24h0|n|Having the quality of sticking to a surface; adhesive; gluey; viscous; viscid; glutinous; tenacious.	N:1hjq,29,1;1poo,15,1~1hjq,29,1;1poo,15,1
24h0|v|Having the quality of sticking to a surface; adhesive; gluey; viscous; viscid; glutinous; tenacious.	s:7d3,36,1~7d3,36,1
