24m3|a|Conjectural; able to conjecture.	j:10yj,97,30;yek,97,446;5y5,88,3;1li2,86,2;4ja,82,44;1glx,81,6;qzk,80,28;6rk,78,3;1r1l,75,47;x3b,69,2;1p3i,67,181;zv,66,7;oqa,62,8;20nf,60,2;qzi,60,50~yek,97,446;1p3i,67,181;qzi,60,50;1r1l,75,47;4ja,82,44;10yj,97,30;35u,50,29;qzk,80,28;1p3g,58,27;1r1j,31,22;1gd6,50,19;gqu,39,15;b2k,57,13;1w7x,37,10;243a,20,10	e:150n,49,3;1scm,47,6;10xs,32,9;2oc,8,6~10xs,32,9;2oc,8,6;1scm,47,6;150n,49,3
