24yh|a|To walk with long steps, especially in a measured or pompous manner. ; To stand with the legs wide apart; to straddle. ; To pass over at a step; to step over. ; To straddle; to bestride.	j:19i8,53,6;21cl,25,2;14ty,22,5;1xh1,5,1~19i8,53,6;14ty,22,5;21cl,25,2;1xh1,5,1
