24zl|n|Consisting of strings, or small threads; fibrous; filamentous; as, a stringy root. ; Capable of being drawn into a string, as a glutinous substance; ropy; viscid; gluely.	a:1f74,4,1~1f74,4,1	v:1ano,52,2~1ano,52,2
